{"id":"word:hebrew:H2796","type":"word","title":"חָרָשׁ","subtitle":"H2796 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a fabricator or any material","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to חָרָשׁ (H2796) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 36 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"חָרָשׁ (chârâsh) means a fabricator or any material First listed occurrence: 1Chr 4 14."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"חָרָשׁ","transliteration":"chârâsh","pronunciation":"khaw-rawsh'","strong":"H2796","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2796","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["חָרָ֖שׁ","חָרָ֣שׁ","וְ/חָרָשֵׁ֣י","לְ/חָרָשֵׁ֤י","חָרָשֵׁ֖י"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",10],["HC/Ncmpc",5],["HNcmpa",4],["HNcmsc",3],["HC/Ncmpa",2],["HR/Ncmpc",2],["HRd/Ncmpa",2],["HTd/Ncmsa",2],["HC/Td/Ncmsa",2],["HNcmpc",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"a fabricator or any material","usage":"artificer, ( ) carpenter, craftsman, engraver, maker, mason, skilful, ( ) smith, worker, workman, such as wrought.","full":"H2796. charash חָרָשׁ noun masculine Exod 38:23 graver, artificer (Phoenician חרש ) — absolute ׳ח (= * חַרָּשׁ ) 35:35 14 t.; construct חָרַשׁ 28:11 2 t.; plural חָֽרָשִׁים Hosea 13:2 7 t.; חֲרָשִׁים 1Chr 4:14 (twice in verse); Neh 11:35 (see below); construct חָֽרָשֵׁי 2Sam 5:11 6 t.; — 1 graver, artificer: a. worker in metal 1Sam 13:19 ; Hosea 8:6 ; 13:2 ; Deut 27:15 ; Jer 10:9 (|| צֹרֵף ), Isa 40:19 (|| id. ), 54:16 ; 1Chr 29:5 ; ׳ח בַּרְזֶל Isa 44:12 ; 2Chr 24:12 ; perhaps also Isa 41:7 (+ צֹרֵף ); apparently = hammer Zech 2:3 (symbolic). b. worker in wood ׳ח עֵץ 2Sam 5:11 = 1Chr 14:1 ( עֵצִים ), 2Kin 12:12 ; 22:6 2Chr 34:11 ; Jer 10:3 ; Isa 40:20 ; 44:13 (see also 1Chr 22:15 below); perhaps also Ezra 3:7 ; 2Chr 24:12 (both || חצב ). c. worker in stone ׳ח קִיר אֶבֶן 2Sam 5:11 = 1Chr 14:1 (omitted אבן ); also of engraving on gems ׳ח אבן Exod 28:11 (P; || חֹתָם מִּתּוּחֵי ); see also following d. in General ׳ח וָעֵץ אֶבֶן 1Chr 22:15 ; idol-maker ׳ח צִירִים Isa 45:16 , compare 44:11 (also 44:12 ; 44:13 above), 2Kin 24:14 , 16 ; Jer 24:1 ; 29:2 (all || מַסְגֵּר ), Exod 35:35 ; 38:23 (both P; both || חשֵׁב ). In חֲרָשִׁים גֵּיא 1Chr 4:14 , הַחֲ ׳גֵּי Neh 11:35 valley of (the) artificers , and חֲרָשִׁים artificers 1Chr 4:14 , ח has ֲ֯ exceptionally, see Ol § 183 a Kö ii, § 60. 5 ; read חָֽרָשִׁים ? 2 figurative ׳ח מַשְׁחִית Ezekiel 21:36 men skilled to destroy .","rootNote":"from 2790 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 4 14","keyReferences":["1Chr 4 14","1Chr 14 1","1Chr 14 1","1Chr 22 15","1Chr 29 5","1Sam 13 19","2Chr 24 12","2Chr 24 12"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":36,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 4 14","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲרָשִׁ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 14 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":14,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/חָרָשֵׁ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 14 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":14,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/חָרָשֵׁ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 15","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/חָרָשֵׁ֥י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 29 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חָרָשִׁ֑ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"1Sam 13 19","book":"1Sam","chapter":13,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/חָרָשׁ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 24 12","book":"2Chr","chapter":24,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/חָרָשִׁ֔ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 24 12","book":"2Chr","chapter":24,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/חָרָשֵׁ֤י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"2Chr 34 11